OL,3,CUniversity opens government-funded lab
OL,4,Cto help train biomedical scientists
OL,6,FA UK university has opened a new
OL,7,Fgovernment-funded laboratory to help
OL,8,Ftrain the next generation of
OL,9,Fbiomedical scientists to work in the
OL,10,FNHS and life sciences sector.
OL,12,FThe #2.5 million facility at the
OL,13,FUniversity of Essex, which includes a
OL,14,Fdedicated cancer diagnostics
OL,15,Flaboratory, was funded by the Office
OL,16,Ffor Students.
OL,18,FThe investment aims to strengthen
OL,19,Ftraining in subjects critical to the
OL,20,FUK's future workforce.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
