OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786241893
OL,3,CUniversity opens government-funded lab
OL,4,Cto help train biomedical scientists
OL,6,FThe Bioscience Skills Training and
OL,7,FResearch Laboratory (BioSTAR-Lab) aims
OL,8,Fto give students hands-on experience
OL,9,Fwith equipment and techniques used in
OL,10,Fmodern healthcare and life sciences
OL,11,Flaboratories.
OL,13,FStudents studying biomedical science,
OL,14,Fbiotechnology, cancer biology and
OL,15,Frelated degrees will use the
OL,16,Flaboratories to carry out their
OL,17,Fresearch projects.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
