OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786241893
OL,3,CUniversity opens government-funded lab
OL,4,Cto help train biomedical scientists
OL,6,FThe facility also includes specialist
OL,7,Fmicrobiology and molecular biology
OL,8,Flaboratories where students will
OL,9,Fanalyse tissue samples, study
OL,10,Finfectious diseases and use molecular
OL,11,Ftechniques.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
