PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786241893
OL,3,CUniversity opens government-funded lab
OL,4,Cto help train biomedical scientists
OL,6,FProfessor Terry McGenity, head of the
OL,7,FSchool of Life Sciences, said: "Here
OL,8,Fat Essex, we are dedicated to
OL,9,Fproviding a rounded education that is
OL,10,Finspired by our world-leading
OL,11,Fresearch, which equips our students
OL,12,Fwith the understanding, skills and
OL,13,Fexperience they need to launch their
OL,14,Fcareers in nationally important
OL,15,Fsectors.
OL,17,F"Hands-on, lab-based research projects
OL,18,Fprovide a transformative experience
OL,19,Ffor our final-year undergraduates and
OL,20,Fmasters students.
OL,26,@oD@`OUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
