PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786241893
OL,3,CUniversity opens government-funded lab
OL,4,Cto help train biomedical scientists
OL,6,F"They allow all our students to become
OL,7,Fpart of the research process by
OL,8,Fcarrying out their project alongside
OL,9,Fexperts, where they apply what they've
OL,10,Flearned, and develop critical
OL,11,Funderstanding of a particular area, as
OL,12,Fwell as new technical and analytical
OL,13,Fskills.
OL,15,F"This new facility will place us at
OL,16,Fthe forefront of training students to
OL,17,Fbe skilled and versatile critical
OL,18,Fthinkers, who will be ready to work in
OL,19,Fthe NHS and life-sciences sectors."
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@AOU{D@cO]
