PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786241893
OL,3,CUniversity opens government-funded lab
OL,4,Cto help train biomedical scientists
OL,6,FThe university said the investment
OL,7,Fcomes at a time of growing demand for
OL,8,Fskilled life scientists, with more
OL,9,Fthan 300,000 people already employed
OL,10,Fin the sector in the UK.
OL,12,FThe lab's opening comes as the
OL,13,FUniversity of Essex launches its first
OL,14,Fundergraduate biotechnology degree,
OL,15,Freflecting growing demand for
OL,16,Fgraduates in a sector that develops
OL,17,Fvaccines, medicines and diagnostic
OL,18,Ftechnologies.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
