PN,30207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786241893
OL,3,CUniversity opens government-funded lab
OL,4,Cto help train biomedical scientists
OL,6,FProfessor Silke Paulmann, executive
OL,7,Fdean of the Faculty of Science and
OL,8,FHealth, said the lab "brings together
OL,9,Feducation, research and real-world
OL,10,Fapplication, creating opportunities
OL,11,Ffor students to develop the expertise
OL,12,Fthat will drive future advances in
OL,13,Fdiagnostics, treatments and public
OL,14,Fhealth".
OL,16,F"It will help strengthen the talent
OL,17,Fpipeline that underpins innovation,
OL,18,Feconomic growth and better health
OL,19,Foutcomes for communities across the
OL,20,FUK," she said.
